Subject: [PATCH 30/41] test: add unit test to check ToggleBssOnReconnect
 feature

New unit test:
- add unit test to check feature EndPoint.ToggleBssOnReconnect:
- 0- activate all vaps of radio's fronthaul
- 1- enable ToggleBssOnReconnect feature
- 2- set radio's endpoint as scanning => vaps shall become inactive
- 3- set radio's endpoint as connecting => vaps shall remain inactive
- 4- set radio's endpoint as in error state (eg wrong password)
  => vaps shall be restored after fh restore delay
- 5- set radio's endpoint as connecting again (fixed password)
  => vaps shall become inactive
- 6- set radio's endpoint as connected
  => vaps shall be restored after fh restore delay

References: PPM-4222
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Amine HAOUES <ahmed-amine.haoues_ext@softathome.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.com/prpl-foundation/prplmesh/pwhm/plugins/pwhm/-/commit/0e951ab41f59db0aaf7b3187cce238e23f15ce22]
